# Tools / governance (Cursor adapter)

1. Read `tools/AGENTS.md` and root `AGENTS.md`.
2. Changes under `.safrs/**`, agent routers, governance scripts, or CI controls are minimum R2.
3. Prefer `pnpm run doctor`, `pnpm run governance`, and `bash scripts/safrs-verify.sh`.
4. Do not weaken tests, security gates, or governance merely to make a task pass.
5. After registry edits, regenerate routing via the documented SAFRS tooling — do not hand-edit generated routing blocks.
